  "cover_text": "When people ask me what my favorite horror film is, my answer is literally the greatest movie ever made. From horror to animation to movies that conraud you for hours, it's a \"what's my favorite?\" game for me. So why do some of our customers complain that this series is just terrible? Until we complete the Kartoon.com Complete Collection, it is very hard to determine someone's favorite. Even when deciding which project is the favorite of the year, there is a noice of disappointment every time the person gets to the end of the list.\nLast week we had a conversation with those very unhappy customers, and it really saddened us. This is what we told them. One would think",
